{
  "id": "workable-s3-post",
  "provenance": "The shape of Workable's upload presign answer and storage POST on its hosted application forms (October 2026), read from a public job's own presign GET and its client code. The page appends Content-Type (the file's type), every presigned field in order, then the file. Field names, the empty utf8 value and the policy conditions are as observed; every other value is synthetic.",
  "fields": {
